  m_Name: Maryna Alekseenko
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PassengerData
  passengerName: Maryna Alekseenko
  portrait: {fileID: -6470460504253458178, guid: 30bec57c9acc09e4e8d91d992e7e8b82, type: 3}
  healthPoints: 100
  charDescription: Maryna Alekseenko is a young lady (14 or so) a bit intimidate
    being around strangers by herself. Curious and dynamic, she seems resourceful,
    good with her hands and small enough to go were other can't. Talking with her
    do not show much of her character or past, but playing a game of cards with her
    is the best way to make her talk. In fact she often make her hands busy by shuffling
    a deck and playing solitary. While in a card game, she might suggest that her
    parents were real heroes, and her deep, seethling hate of the invaders. She is
    the daugther of a civilian resistant movement who were killed. She transport
    with her in a bag a hidden bomb ready to assemble, waiting for the right moment
    to put it in a local commander building to exert her vengeance. She might have
    trouble keeping her cool with the invading forces. If she know that Ivan is a
    quisling, she will hate him and probably vote for his departure of the train,
    and even try to kill him.
  bonus:
  - bagou
  - bidouillage
  - adroit
  - haine de l'envahisseur
  - la bombe
